{
  "info": {
    "name": "Task Todo API",
    "description": "REST API for user authentication and task management.\n\n## Authentication\n\nThe API supports **two auth modes**:\n\n1. **Bearer token** — `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from the login JSON response\n2. **httpOnly cookie** — `auth-jwt` cookie set automatically on `POST /auth/login`\n\nPostman stores the cookie in its cookie jar after **Login**. Protected routes accept either method.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Import this collection\n2. Import `Task-Todo-API.postman_environment.json` (optional)\n3. Start the API: `pnpm dev`\n4. Run **Auth → Login** — saves `{{token}}` and stores the `auth-jwt` cookie\n5. Run protected endpoints (Bearer or cookie variants)\n6. Run **Auth → Logout** to clear the cookie\n\n## Seed user\n\n- Email: `john@example.com`\n- Password: `secret123`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "taskId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": "john"
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "value": "john@example.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "secret123"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Returns `{ status: \"ok\", database: \"connected\" }` — **200**"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', json.id);",
                  "    pm.test('User registered', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(json).to.have.property('id');",
                  "        pm.expect(json).to.have.property('email');",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new user.\n\n**Body:** `username`, `email`, `password`\n\n**Response:** `{ id, username, email }` — **201**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', json.id);",
                  "    pm.test('Login response shape', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(json).to.have.property('id');",
                  "        pm.expect(json).to.have.property('email');",
                  "        pm.expect(json).to.have.property('token');",
                  "    });",
                  "    pm.test('auth-jwt cookie is set', () => {",
                  "        const cookie = pm.cookies.get('auth-jwt', pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl'));",
                  "        pm.expect(cookie).to.exist;",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login and start a session.\n\n**Body:** `email`, `password`\n\n**Response:** `{ id, username, email, token }` — **200**\n\n**Side effects:**\n- Sets `auth-jwt` httpOnly cookie (stored in Postman cookie jar)\n- Saves `{{token}}` for Bearer requests"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Session (Bearer)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.test('Session is valid', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.eql({ authenticated: true });",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/session",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "session"]
            },
            "description": "Check whether the current session is valid using a Bearer token.\n\n**Auth:** `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`\n\n**Response:** `{ authenticated: true }` — **200**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Session (Cookie)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.test('Session is valid via cookie', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.eql({ authenticated: true });",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/session",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "session"]
            },
            "description": "Check whether the current session is valid using the `auth-jwt` cookie only.\n\n**Auth:** `auth-jwt` httpOnly cookie (no Bearer header)\n\nRun **Login** first so Postman stores the cookie.\n\n**Response:** `{ authenticated: true }` — **200**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User (Bearer)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/user",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "user"]
            },
            "description": "Get authenticated user profile using a Bearer token.\n\n**Auth:** `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`\n\n**Response:** `{ id, username, email }` — **200**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User (Cookie)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/user",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "user"]
            },
            "description": "Get authenticated user profile using the `auth-jwt` cookie only.\n\n**Auth:** `auth-jwt` httpOnly cookie (no Bearer header)\n\nRun **Login** first so Postman stores the cookie.\n\n**Response:** `{ id, username, email }` — **200**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', '');",
                  "    pm.test('Logout response', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.eql({ ok: true });",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "End the session and clear the `auth-jwt` httpOnly cookie.\n\n**Response:** `{ ok: true }` — **200**\n\nAlso clears `{{token}}` in collection variables."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tasks",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Tasks (Bearer)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tasks",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["tasks"]
            },
            "description": "List all tasks for the authenticated user.\n\n**Auth:** `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`\n\n**Response:** `[{ id, userId, title, status }]` — **200**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Tasks (Cookie)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tasks",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["tasks"]
            },
            "description": "List all tasks using the `auth-jwt` cookie only.\n\n**Auth:** `auth-jwt` httpOnly cookie (no Bearer header)\n\n**Response:** `[{ id, userId, title, status }]` — **200**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Task by ID",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["tasks", "{{taskId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get a single task by UUID.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token or `auth-jwt` cookie\n\n**Response:** `{ id, userId, title, status }` — **200**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Task",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('taskId', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Buy groceries\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tasks",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["tasks"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new task.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token or `auth-jwt` cookie\n\n**Body:** `title`\n\n**Response:** `{ id, userId, title, status }` — **201**\n\nTask ID is saved to `{{taskId}}` automatically."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Task Status",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"completed\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["tasks", "{{taskId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Update task status.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token or `auth-jwt` cookie\n\n**Body:** `status` — one of: `pending`, `in_progress`, `completed`\n\n**Response:** `{ id, userId, title, status }` — **200**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Task",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["tasks", "{{taskId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Delete a task.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token or `auth-jwt` cookie\n\n**Response:** No content — **204**"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
